    # n "Yeah."
    n "就是。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:246
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_09f83c65:

    # n 3k "Then in that case, I think you should trust her a little more."
    n 3k "既然这样，我觉得你该更信任她一点。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:247
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_9b164341:

    # n "If she needed you, then you would be the first person she would go to, right?"
    n "她要是需要你，第一个找的肯定就是你，不是吗？"

# script-ch3.rpyc:248
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_bae81423:

    # mc "Well... I guess that's true."
    mc "这……说得也是。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:249
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_16331171:

    # n 3c "I mean, some people just have those days."
    n 3c "谁还没个情绪低落的日子啊。"

