translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_587e4a4f:

    # n "You can't always avoid it."
    n "这种事躲不掉的。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:251
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_66712f45:

    # n "If anything, she probably doesn't want you to worry about her because it's not important."
    n "再说了，她大概正是不想让你操心，才说没什么的。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:252
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_77c6db72:

    # mc "Yeah, that's kind of what she said to me..."
    mc "嗯，她也差不多是这么跟我说的……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:253
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_4191d571:

    # mc "Maybe it's not right for me to go against her wishes."
    mc "也许我不该违背她的意愿。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:254
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_37577bf9:

    # n 3a "Exactly."
    n 3a "这就对了。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:255
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_0599259f:

    # n "If she needs you to worry about her, then it'll be a lot more obvious."
    n "真到了需要你担心的时候，会明显得多。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:256
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "嗯……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:257
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_ab0430cd:

    # mc "I should have thought of it that way from the start."
    mc "我一开始就该这么想。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:259
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_de5759f8:

    # "Natsuki fiddles with the book she's holding in her hands."
    "夏树摆弄着手里的漫画。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:260
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_4e52d9cd:

    # n 1q "She..."
    n 1q "她……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:261
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_82eebb9c:

    # n "She really means a lot to you, doesn't she...?"
    n "她对你来说真的很重要，对吧……？"

# script-ch3.rpyc:262
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_f9d65918:

    # mc "Ah--"
    mc "啊——"

# script-ch3.rpyc:263
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_6e3a63d0:

    # mc "Don't get the wrong idea or anything...!"
    mc "你可别误会啊……！"

# script-ch3.rpyc:264
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_d7b4cc75:

    # mc "We've just been friends for a long time."
    mc "我们只是认识很久的朋友。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:265
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_ea513c23:

    # mc "It's normal to be worried about your friends."
    mc "担心朋友不是很正常嘛。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:266
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_74e8c8a1:

    # mc "I mean, you were worried about me, so--"
    mc "再说，你不也担心我了吗，所以——"

# script-ch3.rpyc:267
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_01eaeb75:

    # n 4w "I was not!!"
    n 4w "我才没有！！"

# script-ch3.rpyc:268
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_1011a1fe:

    # n "Jeez...if you're fine, then let's hurry and get started already!"
    n "真是的……既然你没事，那就赶紧开始吧！"

# script-ch3.rpyc:269
translate chinese ch3_start_natsuki_e9ea92f3:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah..."
    mc "好好好……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:279
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_b046af93:

    # "Why does it feel like I'm being watched...?"
    "为什么总觉得有人在看我……？"

# script-ch3.rpyc:280
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_58e4d71b:

    # "I glance around the room."
    "我环视了一圈教室。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:282
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_f5b959b9:

    # "Suddenly, I notice Yuri peering at me from over her book."
    "忽然，我注意到优里正从书本上方偷偷看我。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:284
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_f6654335:

    # "But she looks away just as quickly with a flustered look on her face."
    "但她立刻慌张地移开了视线。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:285
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_2d0373af:

    # "I realize that she won't get anywhere like this."
    "我明白，再这样下去她什么进展也不会有。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:286
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_2963f68b:

    # "I've never really seen Yuri approach anyone or start a conversation on her own accord."
    "我从没见过优里主动接近谁，或是主动开口搭话。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:287
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_5080c5c5:

    # "So, I have no choice but to approach her myself."
    "所以，只能由我主动过去了。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:288
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_ac24567b:

    # "By now, it's a little easier for me to do that."
    "事到如今，这对我来说已经轻松了一些。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:289
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_624fe589:

    # "I stand up from my desk and sit in one next to her own."
    "我从座位上起身，坐到了她旁边的位置。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:291
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_a3dfe221:

    # y 2v "..."
    y 2v "……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:292
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_e34fd7aa:

    # y "I...didn't mean to bother you or anything..."
    y "我……不是有意打扰你的……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:293
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_adb501d9:

    # mc "Relax, you didn't even do anything."
    mc "放松，你什么都没做。"

