translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_e45b137d:

    # y "But..."
    y "可是……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:295
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_5fc73f2b:

    # y "I could tell that you wanted to be alone with your thoughts..."
    y "我看得出来，你想一个人静一静……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:296
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_f936a2cb:

    # mc "Alone with my thoughts...?"
    mc "一个人静一静……？"

# script-ch3.rpyc:297
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_de9a347a:

    # mc "How were you even able to tell that I was thinking like that?"
    mc "你怎么连这个都看得出来？"

# script-ch3.rpyc:298
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_c7dbab07:

    # y 1t "Well..."
    y 1t "这个……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:299
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_a893f40a:

    # y "It's something that I do a lot..."
    y "我自己就经常那样……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:300
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_5a61ff15:

    # y "So it wasn't hard for me to spot based on your posture and expression."
    y "所以光看你的坐姿和神情，我就能分辨出来。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:301
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_191b9255:

    # y 3o "N-Not that I was staring or anything...!"
    y 3o "并、并不是说我在盯着你看……！"

# script-ch3.rpyc:302
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_d9991a92:

    # y "I didn't do anything creepy like that...!"
    y "我才没做那种阴森森的事……！"

# script-ch3.rpyc:303
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_ff234481:

    # mc "In any case, I guess you were right."
    mc "总之，你猜得没错。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:304
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_541c5376:

    # mc "I'm sorry if I caused you any concern."
    mc "让你担心的话，我很抱歉。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:305
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_faa74039:

    # y 1s "Don't apologize..."
    y 1s "不必道歉……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:306
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_d0e854ff:

    # y "Your troubles are only the concern of those who willingly share in that concern."
    y "烦恼，只属于那些甘愿与之共担的人。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:307
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_64808ee1:

    # y "Of course, there are certainly those who find the most comfort in keeping to themselves..."
    y "当然，也确实有人更愿意独自消化……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:308
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_e41ba113:

    # y "But if you would prefer to share what's on your mind, then I would be glad to listen."
    y "但如果你愿意倾诉，我很乐意听你说。"

# script-ch3.rpyc:309
translate chinese ch3_start_yuri_3f26c11b:

    # mc "Ah, it's really not that big of a deal..."
    mc "啊，其实也没什么大不了的……"

# script-ch3.rpyc:310
